    "text_0009": "A Case For Self-Compassion",
    "text_0010": "Do you ever think of self-compassion as a foundation for your success? If not, maybe it’s time to reconsider.",
    "text_0011": "Boundaries, Bandwidth and Burnout",
    "text_0012": "Healthy boundaries aren’t just barriers against what you don’t want. They serve as guards at the door of your authentic self. These guards support you in achieving and sustaining success by protecting your personal energy and well-being.",
    "text_0013": "True You",
    "text_0014": "There's something truly magical about being unapologetically yourself. It's a superpower that sets you apart in the most beautiful way possible. ",
    "text_0015": "The Power of Savvy Self-care",
    "text_0016": "Often framed as an indulgence, self-care is actually a solid investment in our physical, emotional, and mental well-being — and contributes directly to our personal and professional success.",
